        "41. 质数与合数"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "18有6个约数：1，2，3，6，9，18；11只有2个约数：一个是",
        "11本身，另一个是1. 象11这样的数叫做质数，而18这样的",
        "数叫做合数."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "只有两个约数（1和这个数本身）的数叫做质数."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "有两个以上约数的数叫做合数."
